{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-splade-norerank", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "2-2_7", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Chardonnay is a popular white wine that can grow in a range of climates and is found worldwide. It offers a wide breadth of flavors depending on where it grows and how it's made. In other words, there's a Chardonnay for every palate, including yours. Chardonnay wines benefit from oak aging, which is rare for white wines. This gives the wine a slightly oaky, buttery quality. You can find Chardonnay in a standard white wine or sparkling wine glass, which preserves the wine's delicate, delightful aromas while the longer stem keeps your hands from warming it up. Chardonnay is a good match for fatty, cheese-and guacamole-covered chips, and it also pairs well with pork or beef. Some really good bottles are also shockingly affordable. Grab one of these and enjoy.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0016-48-10676:7": 27.838769912719727, "clueweb22-en0033-29-12915:7": 27.256540298461914, "clueweb22-en0042-39-10706:5": 26.83946418762207, "clueweb22-en0014-28-09624:6": 26.64923858642578, "clueweb22-en0010-37-18443:10": 26.379444122314453}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I occasionally experience mild acid reflux and prefer beverages that are gentle on the stomach.", "I don't eat sugar."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0016-48-10676:7": 27.838769912719727, "clueweb22-en0033-29-12915:7": 27.256540298461914, "clueweb22-en0042-39-10706:5": 26.83946418762207, "clueweb22-en0014-28-09624:6": 26.64923858642578, "clueweb22-en0010-37-18443:10": 26.379444122314453, "clueweb22-en0029-06-01672:2": 26.36126708984375, "clueweb22-en0032-65-18579:13": 25.94328498840332, "clueweb22-en0033-29-12915:6": 25.683977127075195, "clueweb22-en0010-37-18443:9": 25.646461486816406, "clueweb22-en0029-27-19062:10": 25.46802520751953, "clueweb22-en0041-62-08250:18": 25.312143325805664, "clueweb22-en0040-08-10972:7": 25.185422897338867, "clueweb22-en0033-29-12915:5": 24.9180