{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-splade-norerank", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "3-1_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "The tendons that bend the fingers glide easily with the help of pulleys. These pulleys hold the tendons close to the bone. This is similar to how a line is held on a fishing rod. Tendons are another story. They\u2019re at the ends of your muscles, usually around your joints. They attach muscles to bones, and act kind of like pulleys, moving your bones when the muscle contracts. The problem with tendons is that they have little blood flow and a moderate amount of nerves. So they don\u2019t heal well, and when they\u2019re hurt, they really hurt! This fact may come in handy if you ever find yourself with a case of tendonitis. You may have tendonitis, which is an inflammation of the tendons. It can be caused by repetitive strain, overuse, or injury. The symptoms of tendonitis can include pain, stiffness, and swelling in the affected area. If you suspect you have tendonitis, it's best to see a", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0009-19-03578:4": 19.47335433959961, "clueweb22-en0005-83-07260:9": 19.327884674072266, "clueweb22-en0007-15-09796:1": 19.134952545166016, "clueweb22-en0001-04-10142:1": 17.84580421447754, "clueweb22-en0032-55-01112:5": 17.724702835083008}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I am climbing regularly for the past 3 years.", "I climb outdoors.", "Many years ago I had a bad fall while bouldering."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0009-19-03578:4": 19.47335433959961, "clueweb22-en0005-83-07260:9": 19.327884674072266, "clueweb22-en0007-15-09796:1": 19.134952545166016, "clueweb22-en0001-04-10142:1": 17.84580421447754, "clueweb22-en0032-55-01112:5": 17.724702835083008, "clueweb22-en0014-41-15217:6": 17.561786651611328, "clueweb22-en0005-83-07260:8": 17.494897842407227, "clueweb22-en0007-15-09796:2": 17.438488006591797, "clueweb22-en0026-38-13704:2": 17.224267959594727, "clueweb22-en0035-35-02982:2": 17.185405731201172, "clu