{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-splade-norerank", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-1_5", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Microneedling is a great alternative. It's a minimally invasive treatment that uses tiny needles to create micro-injuries in the skin, stimulating collagen production and cell turnover. This helps to improve skin texture, reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and even out skin tone. It's a relatively quick and painless procedure, with minimal downtime, making it a great option for those who want to achieve a more radiant and youthful complexion without the need for extensive recovery time. Additionally, microneedling can be customized to address specific skin concerns, such as acne scars, hyperpigmentation, and pore size, making it a versatile treatment option. As someone who is looking for a fast solution, microneedling might be a good fit for you. It's also worth noting that microneedling can be done in combination with other treatments, such as PRP (platelet-rich plasma) therapy, to enhance its effects and address multiple skin concerns at once.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0000-42-05014:3": 30.43579864501953, "clueweb22-en0025-75-16875:3": 29.019372940063477, "clueweb22-en0040-90-12567:1": 28.598915100097656, "clueweb22-en0001-06-14269:3": 27.77001953125, "clueweb22-en0038-11-18082:3": 27.380443572998047}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I've noticed dark spots and uneven tone on my face.", "I have visible pores on my cheeks and nose.", "I usually wear makeup to even out my complexion.", "I use AHA BHA serum once a week.", "I am a 40-year-old woman.", "I'm interested in treatments that improve my skin with minimal downtime."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0000-42-05014:3": 30.43579864501953, "clueweb22-en0025-75-16875:3": 29.019372940063477, "clueweb22-en0040-90-12567:1": 28.598915100097656, "clueweb22-en0001-06-14269:3": 27.77001953125, "clueweb22-en0038-11-18082:3": 27.380443572998047, "clueweb22-en0033-70-