{"metadata": {"team_id": "Organizers", "run_id": "orga-splade-norerank", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "7-1_3", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "To bake bread in the oven, you can start by adding warm water, yeast, and a teaspoon of bread mix to a mixing bowl. Let it stand for 10 minutes. Then, add warm cream, oil, a slightly beaten egg, and the remaining bread mix. Combine the mixture and knead it for 8-10 minutes. Place the dough in a well-greased bowl, cover it, and let it rise in a warm place until it doubles in size, which should take about an hour. Once the dough has risen, shape it into a loaf of your desired shape and place it in a 9x5-inch loaf pan sprayed with non-stick spray. Preheat your oven to 170 degrees Fahrenheit, let the dough rise for about an hour, then bake it in a preheated oven at 350 degrees Fahrenheit for 25 minutes, or until it's golden brown. Enjoy your freshly baked homemade bread!", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0022-12-11850:9": 24.042024612426758, "clueweb22-en0009-48-01840:1": 23.48554229736328, "clueweb22-en0031-30-02300:4": 22.963376998901367, "clueweb22-en0012-79-07678:11": 22.68040657043457, "clueweb22-en0012-32-00944:11": 22.602439880371094}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I enjoy baking.", "I have some basic baking experience."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0022-12-11850:9": 24.042024612426758, "clueweb22-en0009-48-01840:1": 23.48554229736328, "clueweb22-en0031-30-02300:4": 22.963376998901367, "clueweb22-en0012-79-07678:11": 22.68040657043457, "clueweb22-en0012-32-00944:11": 22.602439880371094, "clueweb22-en0009-48-01840:9": 22.54395294189453, "clueweb22-en0044-42-05194:3": 22.176013946533203, "clueweb22-en0041-74-13364:6": 21.971214294433594, "clueweb22-en0030-47-17290:9": 21.774044036865234, "clueweb22-en0031-04-07967:2": 21.64876365661621, "clueweb22-en0040-10-09335:9": 21.632652282714844, "clueweb22-en0022-40-11080:1": 21.575119018554688, "clueweb22-en0002-40-16540:9": 21.48116683959961, "clueweb22-en0024-01-10808:12": 21.3790